# AI Study Assistant

## Overview

AI Study Assistant is a web application that uses an AI API
to help students understand academic topics and generate
useful study material.

## Features

- Ask questions using natural language
- AI-generated explanations
- Input validation
- Loading state
- Error handling
- Empty-response handling
- Responsive interface
- Secure server-side API integration

## Technologies

- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- OpenAI API
- CSS

## Environment Variables

Create a `.env.local` file:

OPENAI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

Never commit this file to GitHub.

## Running the project

npm install
npm run dev

Then open:

http://localhost:3000

## Security

The API key is accessed only from the server-side API route.
It is never exposed in frontend JavaScript or sent to the browser.